    old "{i}Our signature dish for two!{/i}\n{vspace=0}An exquisite spread of maki, sashimi, and nigirizushi, meticulously prepared for you by our master chef. Served alongside accoutrements of soy sauce, wasabi, ponzu, hot mustard, and pickled ginger — with our award-winning presentation that promises to leave you positively rigid with excitement."
